{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["Who dwells in the Negev by the way of the Atharim — the route of the spies, as written there: עלו זה בנגב. And Amalek dwells in the Negev — and Canaanites with them, for it says כי העמלקי והכנעני שם לפניכם." "The Atharim — like אפרוח, אתמול, אזרוע: many alefs come for usage at the beginning of a word."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:50:36.588036232Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}